VPOS vp 0 5
VMID mid 0 2.5
VIN inp mid AC 1
LFB out inn 1G
CFB inn mid 1G
RL out mid 2000
CL out mid 2e-11
Rpark1 park1 mid 100k
Rpark2 park2 mid 100k
Rpark3 park3 mid 100k
XDUT inn inp out park1 mid park1 park2 mid park2 park3 mid park3 nc_NC 0 vp LM324

.ac dec 20 0.1 1G
.meas ac m_a0 FIND V(out) AT 0.1
.meas ac m_ugf WHEN mag(V(out))=1 FALL=1
.meas ac m_ph FIND V(out) WHEN mag(V(out))=1 FALL=1
.end
